{
  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "& si\u00fe\u00fean m\u00e6st ealle Africe gecirdon to \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Romane sendon eft Metellus mid firde angean Geoweor\u00fean, & he sige h\u00e6fde \u00e6t twam & he \u00feeh si\u00fe\u00fean na \u00fey l\u00e6s ne hergeade on Romane. \u00dea sendon hie eft Marius \u00feone consul angean Geoweor\u00fean, a swa lytigne & a swa br\u00e6gdenne swa Ac sona swa Geoweor\u00fea h\u00e6fde his fultum to \u00fe\u00e6re byrg gel\u00e6dd angean Marius, \u00fea forlet he \u00dea ne getruwade Geoweor\u00fea his agnum folce ofer \u00fe\u00e6t, ac ge\u00feoftade him wi\u00fe Bohan, Mauritania & he him com to mid micle monfultume, & oftr\u00e6dlice on Romane stalade, o\u00fe hie gecw\u00e6don To \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte h\u00e6fde Boho Geoweor\u00fean broht to fultume LX M gehorsedra butan fe\u00fean. N\u00e6s na mid Romanum \u00e6r ne si\u00fe\u00fean swa heard gefeoht swa \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s, for \u00feon \u00fee hie wurdon on Toeacan \u00fe\u00e6m hie derede \u00e6g\u00feer ge \u00feurst ge h\u00e6te, & ealne \u00f0one d\u00e6g w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feafiende o\u00fe niht. \u00dea on mergen hie w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t ilce donde, & eft w\u00e6ron on \u00e6lce healfe utan befangen, swa hie \u00e6r & \u00fea hie swi\u00f0ost tweode hw\u00e6\u00f0er hie aweg comen, \u00fea gecw\u00e6don hie \u00fe\u00e6t hie sume hie be\u00e6ftan \u00dea hie swa gedon h\u00e6fdon, \u00fea com an ren; & swi\u00fee Mauritani\u00e6 w\u00e6ron mid \u00fe\u00e6m gewergade, for \u00de",
